{"name":"AlgebraicJacobian.GaloisDescent.StableAffineOpen.quotientChartTopWitness","signature":"noncomputable def quotientChartTopWitness [FiniteDimensional K L] [IsGalois K L] (i : StableAffineOpen ρ) : GaloisQuotientWitnessWithProjection (ρ.restrict i.stable) (quotientChartTopOpen ρ i).toScheme ((quotientChartTopOpen ρ i).ι ≫ quotientChartMap ρ i) (SemilinearGalAction.stableAffineQuotientMapRestrict ρ i.stable i.affine le_rfl i.stable)","file":"MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/AlgebraicJacobian/Picard/GaloisDescent/GaloisQuotientOverlap.lean","line":953,"doc":"The projection-carrying quotient witness obtained by restricting a stable affine chart to the whole chart."}
